{
  "$comment": "Embed tool calling E2E scenarios. Axes: ALLOW (tool calling ON, all skills), DENY (tool calling OFF), FILTER (allowlist filter). Design: docs/02-design/features/embed-tool-calling-e2e-runner.design.md §3.1, §8.3. NO @agent prefix — embed uses native LLM tool calling.",
